# Place your app screenshots here

Add your MindSpace app screenshots to this folder:
- screenshot1.png
- screenshot2.png
- screenshot3.png
- screenshot4.png
- screenshot5.png

The website will automatically load and display them in the carousel.

Recommended image specifications:
- Format: PNG or JPG
- Dimensions: 1080x2340 (mobile screenshot ratio)
- File size: < 500KB each (optimized for web)
